OL,3,GNEWSAWooden bridge restored after
OL,4,Afundraising campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic wooden bridge which was
OL,7,Fdamaged during stormy weather has been
OL,8,Frestored.
OL,10,FNatural England organised the work at
OL,11,Fthe clam bridge which crosses the River
OL,12,FBovey near Lustleigh in Dartmoor,
OL,13,FDevon, after it was damaged by storms
OL,14,Fwhich hit the area in January.
OL,16,FThe restoration was carried out on the
OL,17,Fstructure after a fundraising campaign
OL,18,Finvolving organisations including
OL,19,FLustleigh and Manaton Parish Councils
OL,20,Fand the Dartmoor Trust charity raised
OL,21,Fabout #6,000.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
