OL,3,GNEWSAWooden bridge restored after
OL,4,Afundraising campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistorian Peter Mason said the earliest
OL,7,Fknown map the bridge featured on was in
OL,8,F1834 and it was "absolutely fantastic"
OL,9,Fto have it back.
